    {
      "fact": "To activate change tracking, go to Edit, select Changes, and choose the Record option.",
      "evidence": "record changes ऑप्शन को सेट करने के लिए edit → changes पर जाएँ और record ऑप्शन चुनें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The Show option under Changes must be enabled to visibly record upcoming edits.",
